# FRONTEND LINTING (Jinja2)

**Role:** @Coder / @Tester — lint gate for UI changes in `src/web/`.

**Context:** Commands from `tooling.mdc` § Frontend and § Python.

**Instruction:**
1. Run `uv run ruff check src/web/` (and `uv run mypy src/web/` when view models change) before marking coding/fix complete; failures block handoff.
2. Template lint (`djlint`) only if approved in `tooling.mdc`; otherwise self-check: templates extend `base.html`, no `|safe` on data, no inline `style=`/`on*=`, every `url_for` target exists.
3. `uv run pytest tests/web/ -v` must render every page without `TemplateNotFound` / `UndefinedError` (the app should use `StrictUndefined` in dev/test).
4. Fix root causes; avoid blanket `# noqa` / `{# djlint:off #}`; record commands and exit codes in progress.
5. Lint-only issues stay here — do not duplicate as @CodeReviewer CRITICAL findings.

**Constraints:**
1. Do not disable ruff/djlint rules or add dependencies to «fix» lint without explicit user approval.
2. Scope fixes to the files of the current instruction.
